WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.575
Say it in steps, then write each step.

2
00:00:03.277 --> 00:00:06.027
Three more than twice n: say it in steps.

3
00:00:06.653 --> 00:00:09.528
Twice n is two times n, written two n.

4
00:00:10.381 --> 00:00:13.656
Then three more means add three: two n plus three.

5
00:00:14.483 --> 00:00:18.258
Check with four: twice four is eight, and three more is eleven.

6
00:00:20.194 --> 00:00:23.019
Change n, and the expression still works.
